  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nIf a server admin configures `serve_server_wellknown: true`, the response for `/.well-known/matrix/server` points other servers to `server_name:443` regardless of the value of `public_baseurl`. This breaks federation if Synapse is hosted on a dedicated subdomain and the admin reverse proxies `https://server_name/.well-known/matrix/` back to Synapse.",
  "closed_by": null,
